  "content": "<h1>暗黑鍛造</h1><p><strong>模組說明</strong></p><p>為下界合金升級與盔甲紋飾提供自定義鍛造模板配方</p><p><em>支援伺服器端安裝。只需安裝在伺服器上，玩家客戶端無需安裝即可使用。</em></p><p>由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑RPG</a>原班團隊打造 (完整RPG體驗請下載<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑RPG整合包</a>，享受任務與角色扮演玩法)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色功能</h2><h5>(這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗)</h5><h5>不想費心尋找鍛造模板？或是急著想為盔甲添加特定紋飾？現在可以輕鬆合成模板。使用自定義配方製作各類鍛造模板，並能複製更多模板用於後續鍛造。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(現已包含1.21版本新增的「螺栓」與「流動」盔甲紋飾模板)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含配方：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界合金升級</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哨兵盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">惱鬼盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">荒野盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海岸盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙丘盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">嚮導盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">隆起盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">塑形盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">宿主盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">守衛盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寂靜盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">潮湧盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">豬鼻盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">肋骨盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">眼瞳盔甲紋飾</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建議搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>配方查詢模組使用</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要更多自定義配方？試試包含100+實用配方的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbindings\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑綁定</a>模組</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">範例展示：</span>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/897/123/darksmithing-screenshot.png\" width=\"830\" height=\"1600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器與好友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享25折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
